1
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:22,770
Due to extreme fatigue and malnutrition resulted from not eating.

2
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,190
She has been suffering from serious deprivation of body fluids.

3
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:28,430
So it would be better to keep quiet.

4
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:50,950
You are making things no fun at all like this.

5
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:05,450
Get up!

6
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:12,960
Come around! Kang Yoo Jung.

7
00:02:16,950 --> 00:02:20,870
Oh, you woke up, Kang Yoo Jung!

8
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:34,780
-Let's go! -Yes sir!

9
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,630
This really sucks!

10
00:02:38,030 --> 00:02:40,840
Don't want another girl to die because of me.

11
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,510
It is not your fault, sir!

12
00:02:42,510 --> 00:02:45,620
-I am not asking your opinion. Mind your own business –sorry, sir.

13
00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:47,850
Shut up!

14
00:03:01,450 --> 00:03:05,670
She asked you to bring them here like this?

15
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:08,250
You don't make a penny, yet still want to help others

16
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:11,350
This is why I'm going crazy.

17
00:03:11,350 --> 00:03:15,150
Is Insuk nobody? she is my sister.

18
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:16,830
And also your sister in law.

19
00:03:16,830 --> 00:03:18,420
Anyway, we have to buy fish in other shops even if not from hers.

20
00:03:18,420 --> 00:03:21,160
She said her business was not going well, so i bought some.

21
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:23,240
No big deal!

22
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:25,100
So finally a brother in need.

23
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:29,170
Selling fish for decades, she has never sent us anything for free.

24
00:03:29,170 --> 00:03:32,170
Yes, times are hard for them,

25
00:03:32,170 --> 00:03:35,400
I am no better either, not good at all! ok?

26
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,250
Mom,

27
00:03:38,930 --> 00:03:43,660
Are we too poor to afford some seafood?

28
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,150
No, I didn't mean that!

29
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:47,720
There are only 3 of us.

30
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,120
What your father bought is far too much for us.

31
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,620
A prosecutor is nobody.

32
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:54,850
I have to work very hard, but never is the salary raised.

33
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:57,110
So, let it be!

34
00:03:57,110 --> 00:04:02,630
Why not find a wealthy woman who can open a law office for me to get married?

35
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,890
I will see to it if you are serious.

36
00:04:05,890 --> 00:04:06,790
Bullshit!

37
00:04:06,790 --> 00:04:09,440
Oops! Do not yell at me!

38
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:11,420
Fuck!

39
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:19,300
Are you going to flirt with the rich just for a so-called comfortable life?

40
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:20,870
It is always my hope that you can finally become a upright prosecutor and

41
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:23,650
do justice for those who are poor and wronged.

42
00:04:23,650 --> 00:04:26,400
I am afraid that I failed to meet your expectation.

43
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:29,480
So are you going to give up, then?

44
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,160
You will achieve no success if you give up so easily because of the little hardships.

45
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,190
So how about you, dad?

46
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:36,250
Why do you finally quit?

47
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,730
What?

48
00:04:37,730 --> 00:04:38,470
Do Hoon!

49
00:04:38,470 --> 00:04:40,730
Thanks to your abandoned life,

50
00:04:40,730 --> 00:04:45,600
I have never thought about other ways of living,

51
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:50,310
and have been living like this regrdless of others,

52
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:55,210
because I wanted to achieve your dream and make up for your life.

53
00:04:55,210 --> 00:05:01,310
Do you know how I maintain this position?

54
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:05,700
Do you really konw how hard to stick to it till now?

55
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:11,990
But look at me!

56
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:16,230
Look at you two, quarrelling bitterly over those petty fish!

57
00:05:16,260 --> 00:05:20,660
I am not the great prosecutor as mother thinks,

58
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:23,630
nor the upright one in dad's mind.

59
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:27,630
I cannot do anything on my own.

60
00:05:30,510 --> 00:05:33,730
Do Hoon...

61
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:44,570
Se Yeon, running a hotel is never an easy task.

62
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:49,250
If i think so, i will not be here asking your help, president!

63
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:52,910
Others think I will lead a easy life by painting,

64
00:05:52,910 --> 00:05:54,500
but my actual job was smiling

65
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:59,340
and sucking up to other people in place of my father.

66
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:03,920
And now I have got appropriate education in how to get along with others.

67
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:07,890
With only 14.2% of the shares that Min Hyuk holds,

68
00:06:07,890 --> 00:06:10,960
it's hard to retain K Hotel.

69
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:14,630
I'm going to be part of your family soon.

70
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:22,360
Sir, please give me the purchsed shares of hotel by K Construction.

71
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:37,350
I heard you got the hotel shares from may dad.

72
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,540
I just get what I deserve.

73
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:44,790
Our marriage is a business.

74
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,890
And that thing the other day...

75
00:06:48,890 --> 00:06:52,550
And that thing the other day...

76
00:06:52,790 --> 00:06:55,710
The thing I practised for many days,

77
00:06:55,710 --> 00:06:57,500
but you just walked away regardless of me.

78
00:06:57,500 --> 00:07:00,760
Or the thing you came back proposing with a cheap ring,

79
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:03,520
asking me for help.

80
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,910
Or that

81
00:07:06,510 --> 00:07:11,550
you brougt the girl who killed your girlfriend to me.

82
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:13,500
Listen to me.

83
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:15,950
I've tried to understand you.

84
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:19,860
Would I have done the same thing if you were dead?

85
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,450
Maybe for a while,

86
00:07:21,450 --> 00:07:24,120
I would cry and be upset.

87
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:28,230
But you've been doing this for years. It's an obsession.

88
00:07:28,230 --> 00:07:29,440
Shut up!

89
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:31,670
And this obsession is of no help to you,

90
00:07:31,670 --> 00:07:35,130
and that girl

91
00:07:35,130 --> 00:07:36,680
Shut up! Shin Se Yeon!

92
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:39,470
Stop now! Even so, Seo Ji Hee will

93
00:07:39,470 --> 00:07:41,540
definitely understand you.

94
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:44,850
So stop now! Don't be furious at others.

95
00:07:44,850 --> 00:07:46,190
I said "shut up"!

96
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:49,580
And it is so childish of you to

97
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:51,470
find Kang Yoo Jung blindly.

98
00:07:51,470 --> 00:07:53,270
Do you really think Seo Ji Hee will appreciate it

99
00:07:53,270 --> 00:07:56,260
if you batter that poor girl?

100
00:07:56,260 --> 00:08:00,780
Shin Se Yeon! I told you to stop!

101
00:08:03,090 --> 00:08:05,520
Good! just yell at me if you are angry.

102
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:09,430
Show me your anger and tears.

103
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:39,000
Read it and find out how love-starting

104
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:44,550
revenge ends itself.

105
00:09:22,770 --> 00:09:26,480
Someone already paid your bill.

106
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:31,310
Here you come!

107
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:37,040
Right at the time. Help me with the stuff.

108
00:11:09,430 --> 00:11:12,190
-Hey Did you have supper? -No.

109
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:18,530
Thank you sister!

110
00:11:18,530 --> 00:11:21,810
Don't mention it! No big deal.

111
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:34,300
It's my son. Handsome, right?

112
00:11:36,980 --> 00:11:40,980
He is ill, sriously!

113
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:47,140
What is it? I can't remember what it is. The name is too long.

114
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:53,310
He got it from me. I was to balme.

115
00:11:53,750 --> 00:11:57,710
I have to save him, whatever it takes.

116
00:11:57,710 --> 00:12:00,970
Yes, come on.

117
00:12:01,330 --> 00:12:06,810
It is happiness if I can be with him

118
00:12:07,150 --> 00:12:09,680
even he is seriously sick.

119
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:13,380
Stop looking at me like that!

120
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:18,530
I promised San that I wouldn't cry for him anymore.

121
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:25,300
I was happy that he could be here with me.

122
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:30,190
That's what I think.

123
00:12:30,750 --> 00:12:33,920
And then I can keep on.

124
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:47,390
Sorry, seeing you with San reminds me of my son.

125
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:49,650
And I got jealous.

126
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,810
I was just being petty.

127
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:28,390
No one wants a prosecutor under investigation.

128
00:13:28,390 --> 00:13:33,230
And there are so many law school graduates, Attorneys are everywhere.

129
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:36,580
By the way, what's wrong with you

130
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:39,110
to get such a reputation?

131
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:42,280
It'll be hard for you to get a job anyway.

132
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:49,390
I need to see Mr. Jo Min Hyuk, could you please help me?

133
00:14:05,150 --> 00:14:06,890
What's up?

134
00:14:06,890 --> 00:14:10,730
I receieved this.

135
00:14:10,730 --> 00:14:15,350
The debt that I should pay was transfered to you.

136
00:14:15,350 --> 00:14:18,620
What's going on?

137
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:28,160
It means that you owe me money. Understand?

138
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:29,500
Well, I'm just...

139
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:33,960
I lost much to get rid of those creditors.

140
00:14:36,210 --> 00:14:38,520
What are you looking at?

141
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:44,180
I'll definitely pay you back. Trust me.

142
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:48,060
We are going to be late. Hurry up!

143
00:14:53,130 --> 00:14:58,090
Please believe me. I'll pay you back.

144
00:14:58,090 --> 00:15:00,790
This is my phone number. I won't escape.

145
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:04,120
I'll pay you back, whatever it takes!

146
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:09,010
So, Please don't sell the Bakery. Please!

147
00:15:09,010 --> 00:15:13,960
Oh, yes, the Bakery, is very important to you!

148
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:20,430
But that's why I bought it and I'm going to tear it down.

149
00:15:21,930 --> 00:15:23,780
I told you so.

150
00:15:23,780 --> 00:15:27,620
It's nothing, compared to what you did to me.

151
00:15:27,620 --> 00:15:33,780
Sir, that's just... I..I know what's your relationship with Min Hyuk.

152
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:36,460
But, why you are here?

153
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:37,670
None of your business.

154
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:39,510
I am your fiancee. We are going to get married soon.

155
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:44,820
Last investigation and this debt affair,

156
00:15:44,820 --> 00:15:48,390
I would feel really shameful if i were you!

157
00:15:51,470 --> 00:15:54,090
Escort her out.

158
00:15:54,750 --> 00:15:56,420
Right now!

159
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:04,220
Sir! sir!....

160
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:11,000
Sir! sir! Wait a minute!

161
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:51,070
What you said last time makes feel I would never see you again

162
00:16:51,070 --> 00:16:53,490
What are you doing here?

163
00:16:54,420 --> 00:16:58,950
I don't know.

164
00:17:00,210 --> 00:17:05,240
Just, want to see a different world.

165
00:17:07,730 --> 00:17:11,430
My world is suffocating.

166
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:16,380
I heard that you resigned.

167
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:20,560
I haven't had time to enjoy art before,

168
00:17:21,990 --> 00:17:26,690
as I have to save time for law books.

169
00:17:26,690 --> 00:17:31,400
I've worked hard not to fall behind.

170
00:17:32,610 --> 00:17:38,150
But now I really understand why people come to galleries.

171
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:45,010
So, what's your feeling towards this one?

172
00:17:45,610 --> 00:17:50,210
I wanna go there, if I can.

173
00:17:52,890 --> 00:17:56,610
I like this paiting because I finished it in only one try.

174
00:17:56,610 --> 00:18:02,500
If it was corrected many times, i would forget my innitiation.

175
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:07,500
And then, it's time to change the theme.

176
00:18:08,010 --> 00:18:10,440
But I cannot do this.

177
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:15,160
Of course.

178
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:20,530
It is natural to think that it is a waste of time to think things can be better.

179
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:23,800
Are you talking about yourself?

180
00:18:28,710 --> 00:18:32,100
You're not a good liar, Do Hoon!

181
00:19:28,820 --> 00:19:31,730
-Are you OK? -Yes,

182
00:19:32,050 --> 00:19:36,530
but I need to take them to my car quickly.

183
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:39,970
Give me! I will help you!

184
00:19:39,970 --> 00:19:42,490
But, are you ok for not going to hospital?

185
00:19:42,490 --> 00:19:44,810
- Yes. -Sorry.

186
00:20:01,290 --> 00:20:04,240
Excuse me. We have to check these.

187
00:20:09,320 --> 00:20:11,470
-Hello? -What?

188
00:20:14,940 --> 00:20:19,190
Tolerating for a long time. What's the tolerance?

189
00:20:19,190 --> 00:20:22,080
I told you! not mine!

190
00:20:22,390 --> 00:20:24,810
A lady fell from a bike...

191
00:20:24,810 --> 00:20:27,460
Don't make a story!

192
00:20:32,060 --> 00:20:36,730
- By the way, you know me? - What?

193
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:44,190
Are you the hit-and-run? killing a mother and baby.

194
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:48,940
Yes, it's you.

195
00:20:49,670 --> 00:20:53,000
You are breaking the law again in such a very short time out of jail.

196
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:56,560
I really cannot understand you.

197
00:20:56,560 --> 00:20:59,210
Born on July 20th, right?

198
00:20:59,210 --> 00:21:02,110
Not mine! I mean it!

199
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:04,850
How can we trust you?

200
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:08,360
Is there anyone who can vouch for you?

201
00:21:13,330 --> 00:21:15,120
I really enjoyed your paintings thanks to you.

202
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:16,910
So see you next time.

203
00:21:16,910 --> 00:21:20,370
I'm having a drink with some friends, would you like to join us?

204
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:24,010
You just left like that the other day.

205
00:21:24,450 --> 00:21:27,240
-Se Yeon! -Hi!

206
00:21:27,690 --> 00:21:32,250
-Are you finished? Where are we going? Who's this guy? -What?

207
00:21:33,770 --> 00:21:35,690
Are you having an affair?

208
00:21:35,690 --> 00:21:39,540
- What if Min Hyuk finds out? -We're not... - Yes.

209
00:21:40,100 --> 00:21:43,010
That's right. That's what it is.

210
00:21:43,010 --> 00:21:48,560
Min Hyuk likes scandal. Why not spread it?

211
00:21:48,740 --> 00:21:52,830
- It does't look like so - Yes, we are,

212
00:21:53,380 --> 00:21:56,140
if that's what Se Yeon thinks.

213
00:21:58,730 --> 00:22:01,170
What?

214
00:22:02,890 --> 00:22:04,370
Where are you going?

215
00:22:04,370 --> 00:22:06,010
Come on, let's go together!

216
00:22:06,010 --> 00:22:09,120
Yes. Girls drinking together can be boring.

217
00:22:15,170 --> 00:22:17,280
What's your job?

218
00:22:19,060 --> 00:22:22,310
What do you think he does?

219
00:22:24,770 --> 00:22:29,120
He's currently out of work. But he was a civil servant not long before.

220
00:22:30,580 --> 00:22:31,840
Uh...

221
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:35,230
How long have you been known each other?

222
00:22:35,500 --> 00:22:38,000
Almost 4 years.

223
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:44,270
Black dress and red high heels.

224
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:47,950
You were drunk and yelling.

225
00:22:48,950 --> 00:22:53,410
You asked me if I had enjoyed the show.

226
00:22:55,860 --> 00:22:57,760
That was how we met, right?

227
00:22:58,360 --> 00:23:00,630
The day we first met each other.

228
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:04,300
Do you remember that?

229
00:23:07,710 --> 00:23:13,050
I do. I was a little drunk too.

230
00:23:18,150 --> 00:23:22,740
The Shinhwa Hotel is elected to be the world polem.

231
00:23:23,060 --> 00:23:26,290
Se Yeons can do everything.

232
00:23:26,850 --> 00:23:28,430
It's not because of Se Yeon.

233
00:23:28,430 --> 00:23:32,150
What? Are you standing up for your wife?

234
00:23:32,150 --> 00:23:34,440
Uh, yes,

235
00:23:36,980 --> 00:23:39,050
you don't have any frieng, either, right?

236
00:23:41,360 --> 00:23:43,110
Why would I need friends?

237
00:23:43,110 --> 00:23:47,300
Good for you, being a rich beggar without any friends.

238
00:23:49,300 --> 00:23:54,840
But, anyway, I don't really know whether i should marry Se Yeon.

239
00:23:54,840 --> 00:23:56,680
Don't be childish.

240
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:59,540
Your company isn't a mom and pop store.

241
00:23:59,540 --> 00:24:04,500
A mere mistake you make will give you the rumor that you are not qulified to inHae Rit the big business and

242
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:07,230
they'll tear a strip off you.

243
00:24:07,860 --> 00:24:13,440
- If you want to keep your position, you need Se Yeon. - I don't know.

244
00:24:14,650 --> 00:24:19,890
- If you don't want her, can I have her? -What?

245
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:22,930
My family have always been pushing me have a second marriage.

246
00:24:22,930 --> 00:24:25,670
I would really appreciate it if i can have Se Yeon as my wife.

247
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:30,190
Are you crazy? No way!

248
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:35,050
She deserves a guy way better than you and me.

249
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:39,840
I'm warning you. Stay away from her.

250
00:24:47,770 --> 00:24:49,340
This sucks.

251
00:25:02,120 --> 00:25:04,730
This is my phonenumber.

252
00:25:04,730 --> 00:25:06,540
I won't escape.

253
00:25:06,540 --> 00:25:08,310
I'll pay you back, whatever it takes!

254
00:25:08,310 --> 00:25:14,030
So, Please don't sell the Bakery.

255
00:25:33,290 --> 00:25:35,460
You have to pay me back anyway. Please!

256
00:26:08,730 --> 00:26:10,300
Designated driver

257
00:26:26,590 --> 00:26:29,280
I wanted to help a woman,

258
00:26:30,460 --> 00:26:34,430
no, save her, exactly.

259
00:26:35,800 --> 00:26:38,970
But, I failed.

260
00:26:40,280 --> 00:26:42,550
And it is too late now.

261
00:26:45,810 --> 00:26:50,220
The mere look at Se Yeon will remind me of that woman.

262
00:26:52,760 --> 00:26:57,170
Do you think I am the man needing help?

263
00:26:57,170 --> 00:26:58,860
Don't you?

264
00:27:01,470 --> 00:27:08,090
The man who does't care won't here any rumors even if you spread them.

265
00:27:09,690 --> 00:27:13,920
So, you'll have to show hime instead.

266
00:27:33,160 --> 00:27:34,740
Do Hoon,

267
00:27:35,940 --> 00:27:40,790
Thank you and....sorry.

268
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:43,640
I have no one to turn to.

269
00:27:46,600 --> 00:27:51,700
You refused my offer of help, for distributing illegal flyers?

270
00:27:51,700 --> 00:27:54,810
After asking Jo Min Hyuk for money, should you do this dirty job.

271
00:27:54,810 --> 00:27:56,830
No, that's not what you think.

272
00:28:03,730 --> 00:28:06,910
This is an organization for ex-convicts.

273
00:28:07,540 --> 00:28:10,460
They'll find you a job.

274
00:28:10,470 --> 00:28:13,090
It is you who wanted to breake up with me.

275
00:28:13,090 --> 00:28:18,400
I do't want to see you again over something like this.

276
00:28:35,600 --> 00:28:38,890
- Hello? -Designated driver - Hello!

277
00:28:39,370 --> 00:28:42,660
- Come and pick me up - What?

278
00:28:46,560 --> 00:28:48,620
Hey, Driver!

279
00:28:49,670 --> 00:28:54,420
Driver Driver Driver

280
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:59,570
You drive the car!

281
00:28:59,570 --> 00:29:02,010
I cannot drive!

282
00:29:03,260 --> 00:29:05,230
My license was revoked.

283
00:29:05,230 --> 00:29:10,250
Oh, yes, hit and run!

284
00:29:12,010 --> 00:29:14,790
Then, why are you here?

285
00:29:16,650 --> 00:29:20,360
You sounded really drunk, so I came to see if you are okay.

286
00:29:20,790 --> 00:29:23,970
So were you worried?

287
00:29:25,650 --> 00:29:34,020
Who do you think you are? Are you well enough to worry about me?

288
00:29:34,460 --> 00:29:36,650
I'll call a driver for you.

289
00:29:36,650 --> 00:29:40,440
No. Give me the keys!

290
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:44,930
Let me go.

291
00:29:48,730 --> 00:29:52,390
No, don you want to be a man like me?

292
00:30:47,530 --> 00:30:50,720
Where should I take you?

293
00:30:50,740 --> 00:30:52,670
Wait a minute please!

294
00:30:55,150 --> 00:30:59,300
Wake up, sir?

295
00:31:20,060 --> 00:31:22,610
Did you have a good sleep?

296
00:31:23,500 --> 00:31:25,720
Why are you here?

297
00:31:28,870 --> 00:31:30,820
Don't you remember?

298
00:31:30,820 --> 00:31:32,710
You were so drunk last night

299
00:31:32,710 --> 00:31:37,230
that you couldn't tell me where you lived.

300
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:54,490
You had drunk to much.

301
00:31:59,410 --> 00:32:01,290
Have some breakfast.

302
00:32:05,530 --> 00:32:09,090
Do you expect me to eat this?

303
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:12,710
Eat before it gets cold.

304
00:32:14,630 --> 00:32:16,690
And...

305
00:32:19,220 --> 00:32:24,670
I've written down how I can pay off my debt.

306
00:32:26,520 --> 00:32:29,050
I've been working really hard.

307
00:32:29,050 --> 00:32:31,580
I think I can pay you off earlier than I thought.

308
00:32:31,580 --> 00:32:35,500
About the bakery, can I...

309
00:32:35,500 --> 00:32:36,880
Stop!

310
00:33:00,500 --> 00:33:02,860
Water! Water!

311
00:33:02,860 --> 00:33:05,700
Water！Uh, water!

312
00:33:19,300 --> 00:33:22,310
Nobady pours water like you.

313
00:33:22,310 --> 00:33:27,400
It's okay. Don't worry about me.

314
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:33,750
Stop smiling. Stop smiling in my face.

315
00:33:59,570 --> 00:34:01,720
Unbelievable! This is unbelievable!

316
00:34:07,870 --> 00:34:09,440
Sir!

317
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:24,040
Uh? This... you left this.

318
00:34:24,890 --> 00:34:30,290
Your telephone was left in the car at the parking lot.

319
00:34:41,370 --> 00:34:44,000
I am not troubling you!

320
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:46,050
This is coming off your debt.

321
00:34:46,050 --> 00:34:47,430
Okay.

322
00:34:48,160 --> 00:34:50,900
So what about the Bakery?

323
00:35:20,410 --> 00:35:26,730
I'm not interested in seeing someone who turned down my offer.

324
00:35:43,370 --> 00:35:48,660
I didn't know the K Corporation was interested in works of art

325
00:35:48,660 --> 00:35:55,820
The K Culture Center is buying young artists' pieces in bulk at high prices..

326
00:35:55,820 --> 00:35:58,230
And Shinhwa Gallery is the main dealing place.

327
00:35:58,230 --> 00:36:02,180
And the Shinhwa Corporation gets billions of dollars in fees.

328
00:36:04,550 --> 00:36:07,420
This is what I found over the last 2 years.

329
00:36:07,420 --> 00:36:11,980
I really know how to keep a close relationship with Shinhwa.

330
00:36:11,980 --> 00:36:17,100
Are you here to state the obvious?

331
00:36:17,100 --> 00:36:20,900
The prosecution will definitely know waht i know.

332
00:36:20,900 --> 00:36:25,600
If we do things for the cause of the country, everything's forgivable. And this is South Korea.

333
00:36:25,640 --> 00:36:27,370
However, the K Corporation isn't a company that contributes to the country's economy.

334
00:36:27,370 --> 00:36:31,710
And not a representation in this country in Export Industry.

335
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,820
In this perspective,

336
00:36:33,820 --> 00:36:37,030
K Corporation is an easy target for the government.

337
00:36:37,030 --> 00:36:41,430
Because they always need a scapegoat to divert people's attention.

338
00:36:42,050 --> 00:36:47,310
Next week, they'll announce the sale of the Incheon Harbors facilities.

339
00:36:47,310 --> 00:36:50,210
They're going to carry out another investigation on K.

340
00:36:50,210 --> 00:36:54,310
And this time, the investigation will not focus only on the case.

341
00:36:54,310 --> 00:36:59,660
If you've got your prey in your sights, why do you come to me?

342
00:36:59,730 --> 00:37:04,500
I want you to give me another chance.

343
00:37:04,500 --> 00:37:09,690
Why would I give you another chance

344
00:37:09,690 --> 00:37:11,570
if the prosecution will finally know about this?

345
00:37:11,570 --> 00:37:13,060
Knowing is strength.

346
00:37:13,060 --> 00:37:14,920
I can protect you.

347
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:21,390
I won't let you sit in a wheelchair again.

348
00:37:37,530 --> 00:37:40,110
Why did you change your mind?

349
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:42,430
Don't worry!

350
00:37:42,430 --> 00:37:46,810
I'm not here to take your position.

351
00:37:46,810 --> 00:37:51,380
I'll reach the top of the K Corporation.

352
00:37:51,660 --> 00:37:57,150
I have fed up with the guys who can get everything without any efforts with their parents' money.

353
00:37:57,150 --> 00:38:02,070
I'd like to see a guy like you, who worked hard to get here, win.

354
00:38:05,860 --> 00:38:08,000
But listen.

355
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:13,090
The only person that President Jo wants to see succeeding is Jo Min Hyuk even if he beats Min Hyuk.

356
00:38:13,090 --> 00:38:15,300
You can't be Min Hyuk.

357
00:38:15,300 --> 00:38:20,040
No matter how hard you try, you're just a loyal dog that President Jo feeds.

358
00:38:20,460 --> 00:38:21,580
So just wait and see.

359
00:38:21,580 --> 00:38:23,430
I'm not like President Jo.

360
00:38:23,430 --> 00:38:30,300
I don't think a man who can thorw away principles like you are trustworthy.

361
00:38:36,050 --> 00:38:38,130
I will always keep a close eye on you.

362
00:38:38,130 --> 00:38:40,380
Take care.

363
00:39:10,900 --> 00:39:13,690
Oh my god! Yoo Jung.

364
00:39:15,540 --> 00:39:20,880
Unbelievable! Nice seeing you here!

365
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:22,280
Do you know how I was worreid when

366
00:39:22,280 --> 00:39:24,940
I heard that you lived here.

367
00:39:24,940 --> 00:39:27,650
Hasn't she been mean to you?

368
00:39:27,650 --> 00:39:29,510
No way, just the other way round. She is always naging me

369
00:39:29,510 --> 00:39:31,610
not to drink too much and to get up early.

370
00:39:31,610 --> 00:39:34,060
So don't drink too much and get up early.

371
00:39:34,060 --> 00:39:36,640
Are you here on vocation?

372
00:39:36,640 --> 00:39:38,240
Look, Yoo Jung!

373
00:39:38,240 --> 00:39:42,700
If you don't feel comfortable staying here, or if you have a fight with her,

374
00:39:42,700 --> 00:39:45,640
come to my place.

375
00:39:45,640 --> 00:39:49,400
I live alone. I have no boyfriend. I will charge less.

376
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:52,080
Okay, Thank you.

377
00:39:52,410 --> 00:39:54,470
By the way, where do we take these?

378
00:39:54,470 --> 00:39:56,380
Where can we sell these?

379
00:39:56,380 --> 00:39:58,710
Places like Dongdaemun Market? But we just bought these there.

380
00:39:58,710 --> 00:39:59,910
Yoo Jung, this is...

381
00:39:59,910 --> 00:40:02,360
Oh, how can you call it this or that?

382
00:40:02,360 --> 00:40:06,550
Yoo Jung, don't use this or that.

383
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:09,460
Call it “my baby”.

384
00:40:09,460 --> 00:40:11,980
Isn't my “baby” cute?

385
00:40:11,980 --> 00:40:15,520
There are just so many big fans of our “baby”.

386
00:40:15,520 --> 00:40:17,350
They're lined up for them.

387
00:40:17,350 --> 00:40:20,320
Just leave Sellieg bain to us,

388
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:24,410
You can take your time moving the boxes

389
00:40:25,350 --> 00:40:27,370
How should we recover the investment fund

390
00:40:27,370 --> 00:40:31,330
to maintain the world polem?

391
00:40:31,330 --> 00:40:35,770
It's said the CEO of Shenya Hotel is in charge on him own.

392
00:40:35,770 --> 00:40:39,310
Why do we let the general manager do it?

393
00:40:39,310 --> 00:40:42,730
To reverse the deficit of first half of the year.

394
00:40:42,730 --> 00:40:45,500
We have to make sure polem get maintained.

395
00:40:45,500 --> 00:40:48,990
Do we have a campaign for the second half?

396
00:40:48,990 --> 00:40:52,260
I heard we have a problem in the terminal maintainence of polem.

397
00:40:52,260 --> 00:40:54,190
Do you know that?

398
00:40:54,190 --> 00:40:57,940
The committee was said to have already decided unofficially that they'd pick Shinhwa Hotel.

399
00:40:57,940 --> 00:41:01,250
I guess you barely know that.

400
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:09,560
Should I reveal the names that chose Shinhwa?

401
00:41:20,890 --> 00:41:29,910
Hello, Mr president? Can't you hear me?

402
00:41:29,970 --> 00:41:37,390
Hello? Hello? President?

403
00:42:12,080 --> 00:42:13,520
Shin Se Yeon!

404
00:42:16,600 --> 00:42:19,520
Come on! You gotta meet friends?

405
00:42:19,520 --> 00:42:24,030
I have something to celebrate and I need Se Yeon's bless.

406
00:42:24,030 --> 00:42:26,430
So it's me who invited her.

407
00:42:27,140 --> 00:42:29,700
Do I even need your permission to meet friends?

408
00:42:29,700 --> 00:42:31,130
Friends?

409
00:42:31,130 --> 00:42:33,510
Let's go. I have my car ready.

410
00:42:33,510 --> 00:42:36,090
I'm a friend too.

411
00:42:36,090 --> 00:42:39,270
I can be part of the celebration, can't I?

412
00:42:53,110 --> 00:42:55,510
You are such a real friend,

413
00:42:55,510 --> 00:42:58,810
to get Se Yeon here.

414
00:42:58,810 --> 00:43:00,920
I asked her.

415
00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:04,260
I don't get to see her paintings that often.

416
00:43:04,260 --> 00:43:05,430
I thought you are not so shameless.

417
00:43:05,430 --> 00:43:07,320
Prosecutor Ahn.

418
00:43:07,320 --> 00:43:11,090
Oh, forgot it. You are not a prosecutor anymore.

419
00:43:11,090 --> 00:43:13,650
Not easy to get a job in our company, right?

420
00:43:13,650 --> 00:43:14,770
You are so excellent!

421
00:43:14,770 --> 00:43:16,000
Thank you.

422
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:18,750
Of course you should go out with girls that match you.

423
00:43:18,750 --> 00:43:20,530
Well, That's true.

424
00:43:20,530 --> 00:43:21,410
If you have someone in mind,

425
00:43:21,410 --> 00:43:23,740
save them for me.

426
00:43:23,740 --> 00:43:28,260
Is there anyone like Se Yeon?

427
00:43:32,870 --> 00:43:35,620
Se Yeon is my fiancee.

428
00:43:35,620 --> 00:43:37,840
Since you are working in K Corporation,

429
00:43:37,840 --> 00:43:39,690
she is your boss.

430
00:43:39,690 --> 00:43:42,060
Mind your manners.

431
00:43:42,060 --> 00:43:45,620
She is not the kind of woman that you deserve.

432
00:43:45,620 --> 00:43:47,380
Oh, you should know that.

433
00:43:47,380 --> 00:43:49,180
Then why would you treat her as some random girl?

434
00:43:49,180 --> 00:43:49,770
Like you just said,

435
00:43:49,770 --> 00:43:53,720
Se Yeon can't be treated like that.

436
00:43:53,720 --> 00:43:56,610
I don't think

437
00:43:56,610 --> 00:43:59,520
you have any right to say anything about our relationship.

438
00:43:59,520 --> 00:44:03,640
You are the one who is mean to her! Jo Min Hyuk

439
00:44:03,640 --> 00:44:05,720
I wanna take her from you

440
00:44:05,720 --> 00:44:10,360
even if I know I don't deserve her.

441
00:44:11,240 --> 00:44:13,800
Don't you think you are what I am

442
00:44:13,800 --> 00:44:16,940
for drinking with me.

443
00:44:16,940 --> 00:44:18,970
No matter how you got in my company,

444
00:44:18,970 --> 00:44:19,880
I'm you boss.

445
00:44:19,880 --> 00:44:21,150
And nothing can change that

446
00:44:21,150 --> 00:44:22,940
You are still not going anywhere even I give you a treat like this.

447
00:44:22,940 --> 00:44:26,020
It can't be more obvious.

448
00:44:28,780 --> 00:44:32,390
Days of free-ride can be.

449
00:44:32,790 --> 00:44:35,120
It's obviously shameless to enjoy all you have

450
00:44:35,120 --> 00:44:36,960
with your parents' money?

451
00:44:36,960 --> 00:44:40,400
How dare you say that?

452
00:44:40,400 --> 00:44:43,660
Jo Min Hyuk! Are you here to have a fight?

453
00:44:43,660 --> 00:44:46,400
Haven't you heard what he said?

454
00:44:46,400 --> 00:44:48,580
It's ok.

455
00:44:48,580 --> 00:44:51,470
He said nothing wrong.

456
00:44:51,470 --> 00:44:53,780
I don't think it's okay.

457
00:44:53,780 --> 00:44:55,630
He is my guest.

458
00:44:55,630 --> 00:44:59,250
I don't want him to be unhappy.

459
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:10,300
You still cook?

460
00:45:10,300 --> 00:45:11,800
Once in a while.

461
00:45:11,800 --> 00:45:14,480
You've never cooked for me.

462
00:45:14,480 --> 00:45:18,300
You've never asked me.

463
00:45:23,210 --> 00:45:26,700
It's great, Se Yeon.

464
00:46:10,890 --> 00:46:16,920
I don't think he doesn't have feelings for you.

465
00:46:16,920 --> 00:46:20,260
He does, as men see it.

466
00:46:22,910 --> 00:46:26,190
You are such a good actor, Do Hoon!

467
00:46:26,190 --> 00:46:28,570
I thought you don't lie.

468
00:46:28,570 --> 00:46:32,830
A girl who you want to take away from him?

469
00:46:32,830 --> 00:46:36,090
That wasn't a lie.

470
00:46:37,990 --> 00:46:45,860
Now I could understand why people in TV series fall in love an get married in real life.

471
00:46:46,930 --> 00:46:49,020
If you are too into the characters,

472
00:46:49,020 --> 00:46:52,260
that can happen.

473
00:47:12,830 --> 00:47:14,540
Oops, so hot!

474
00:47:14,540 --> 00:47:15,470
]What?

475
00:47:15,470 --> 00:47:17,920
You want me to drink this?

476
00:47:17,920 --> 00:47:22,290
Nothing is better than this after exhausting work.

477
00:47:25,290 --> 00:47:27,620
It's too sweet.

478
00:47:28,160 --> 00:47:30,800
Whatever.

479
00:47:31,740 --> 00:47:34,200
Besides, are you kidding me?

480
00:47:34,200 --> 00:47:35,990
30 years?

481
00:47:35,990 --> 00:47:37,480
Do you think I would keep seeing you for 30 years

482
00:47:37,480 --> 00:47:40,260
simply for the little money.

483
00:47:40,260 --> 00:47:43,280
Well it's big money for me.

484
00:47:43,280 --> 00:47:45,240
I promise I'd work hard,

485
00:47:45,240 --> 00:47:48,070
So I'll be able to pay up a few years earlier.

486
00:47:48,070 --> 00:47:49,450
A few years?

487
00:47:49,450 --> 00:47:51,260
No way.

488
00:47:51,260 --> 00:47:52,990
You said you had a boyfriend.

489
00:47:52,990 --> 00:47:56,570
Why don't you ask him for some help?

490
00:47:57,570 --> 00:47:58,360
What now?

491
00:47:58,360 --> 00:48:00,370
Dumped?

492
00:48:00,370 --> 00:48:02,700
Right?

493
00:48:02,700 --> 00:48:03,830
Of course you are.

494
00:48:03,830 --> 00:48:05,830
An ex-criminal with big debt to pay?

495
00:48:05,830 --> 00:48:07,630
Who would take her?

496
00:48:07,630 --> 00:48:08,930
He is not the kind man.

497
00:48:08,930 --> 00:48:11,800
Fuck that, he surely is.

498
00:48:11,800 --> 00:48:14,080
Going out as if you are the one to him,

499
00:48:14,080 --> 00:48:16,640
and slipping away as long as you bring up marriage.

500
00:48:16,640 --> 00:48:18,590
Aren't the guys you went out with all like that?

501
00:48:18,590 --> 00:48:21,300
I said he is not!

502
00:48:23,580 --> 00:48:29,160
I am an ex criminal with a huge debt,

503
00:48:29,160 --> 00:48:31,060
but we didn't break up for that.

504
00:48:31,060 --> 00:48:36,720
He isn't the kind of man that you said.

505
00:48:36,720 --> 00:48:39,690
Even after we broke up,

506
00:48:40,140 --> 00:48:41,930
when I did something stupid,

507
00:48:41,930 --> 00:48:44,830
he took me to a hospital to save me.

508
00:48:44,830 --> 00:48:47,210
He's been caring for me all the time quietly.

509
00:48:47,210 --> 00:48:50,610
He just left quietly in case I get guilty.

510
00:48:50,610 --> 00:48:56,570
Hey, that was...

511
00:48:56,570 --> 00:49:03,750
So, don't think you know everything.

512
00:49:23,140 --> 00:49:25,730
Ahn Do Hoon.

513
00:49:25,730 --> 00:49:29,570
I had no idea you are so great.

514
00:49:49,140 --> 00:49:51,330
This is all my savings

515
00:49:51,330 --> 00:49:53,820
and my pension.

516
00:49:53,820 --> 00:49:56,180
Pension?

517
00:49:56,580 --> 00:49:59,250
I am in the Legal Team of K Corporation.

518
00:49:59,250 --> 00:50:01,680
The pay is great.

519
00:50:03,140 --> 00:50:06,540
Do Hoon, are you sure about your decision?

520
00:50:06,540 --> 00:50:07,570
Yes

521
00:50:07,570 --> 00:50:09,900
I'm not giving up my dream.

522
00:50:09,900 --> 00:50:13,440
I chose this not to give up my dream.

523
00:50:13,440 --> 00:50:16,300
I found a good location for a restaurant.

524
00:50:16,300 --> 00:50:18,250
You should go check it.

525
00:50:18,250 --> 00:50:19,160
Restaurant?

526
00:50:19,160 --> 00:50:22,530
Don't work for anybody.

527
00:50:22,530 --> 00:50:24,950
I would give the money you need.

528
00:50:24,950 --> 00:50:26,460
You would rest even if I tell you to.

529
00:50:26,460 --> 00:50:28,790
And that's why I say this.

530
00:50:28,790 --> 00:50:31,330
You've been quarreling all you life.

531
00:50:31,330 --> 00:50:34,330
I would never wanna see

532
00:50:34,330 --> 00:50:36,100
You live the life suffering because of me,

533
00:50:36,100 --> 00:50:37,850
the life taking care of me only.

534
00:50:37,850 --> 00:50:39,850
The money won't be wasted

535
00:50:39,850 --> 00:50:43,740
only if it's given to parents.

536
00:50:51,450 --> 00:50:53,430
Mom, I like this one.

537
00:50:53,430 --> 00:50:56,470
That's for the eldly.

538
00:50:56,700 --> 00:50:58,860
How about this one?

539
00:50:58,860 --> 00:50:59,980
I want this one,

540
00:50:59,980 --> 00:51:02,370
and the red one. I want both.

541
00:51:02,370 --> 00:51:03,400
Just take one of them.

542
00:51:03,400 --> 00:51:04,380
Why?

543
00:51:04,380 --> 00:51:06,460
You barely use them!

544
00:51:06,460 --> 00:51:08,090
It would be a waste of money for you.

545
00:51:08,090 --> 00:51:09,820
All my friends have so many of them that they don't know

546
00:51:09,820 --> 00:51:12,740
which one to choose when they go out.

547
00:51:12,740 --> 00:51:14,300
I'm gonna tell your father that

548
00:51:14,300 --> 00:51:16,000
you skip classes and come here if insist.

549
00:51:16,000 --> 00:51:18,370
Mother!

550
00:51:18,370 --> 00:51:21,990
Now you are like my step-mother.

551
00:51:23,690 --> 00:51:27,620
Min Joo, your friends' parents buy them everything

552
00:51:27,620 --> 00:51:31,090
because they don't care about them

553
00:51:31,750 --> 00:51:33,640
How about let me find you someone,

554
00:51:33,640 --> 00:51:36,180
and buy you a better one?

555
00:51:36,180 --> 00:51:38,410
Really?

556
00:51:47,160 --> 00:51:49,980
Did mom want me to buy a knockoff?

557
00:51:49,980 --> 00:51:51,960
Miss, this isn't an ordinary knockoff.

558
00:51:51,960 --> 00:51:53,650
We used the same leather with the real one,

559
00:51:53,650 --> 00:51:54,870
and the stitches are class A,

560
00:51:54,870 --> 00:51:57,120
and a Chinese craftsman made every stitch carefully...

561
00:51:57,120 --> 00:52:02,420
Oh my princess, you are so pretty.

562
00:52:02,420 --> 00:52:03,950
You are truly right.

563
00:52:03,950 --> 00:52:05,130
It is a knockoff.

564
00:52:05,130 --> 00:52:07,190
But who would know that?

565
00:52:07,190 --> 00:52:10,360
It depends completely on how you see it.

566
00:52:10,360 --> 00:52:12,730
Princess, please close your eyes.

567
00:52:12,730 --> 00:52:13,830
1,2,3.

568
00:52:13,830 --> 00:52:17,190
Now look at this one.

569
00:52:17,190 --> 00:52:20,150
Ok, it really suits you.

570
00:52:20,150 --> 00:52:22,020
Try to empty your mind.

571
00:52:22,020 --> 00:52:24,350
123 open your eyes!

572
00:52:24,350 --> 00:52:28,200
You can see it right? Beautiful line and glossy facade.

573
00:52:28,200 --> 00:52:29,570
Oh my pretty child.

574
00:52:29,570 --> 00:52:32,700
Look at the glossy facade.

575
00:52:32,700 --> 00:52:35,080
No one could match me.

576
00:52:35,080 --> 00:52:36,900
Look at it!

577
00:52:36,900 --> 00:52:39,960
No matter what, this kind of bag…

578
00:52:39,960 --> 00:52:41,920
Min Joo.

579
00:52:41,920 --> 00:52:44,520
Isn't it great to have a lot of bags,

580
00:52:44,520 --> 00:52:46,030
and use a different one everyday?

581
00:52:46,030 --> 00:52:49,180
And you could get relaxed.

582
00:52:49,270 --> 00:52:54,020
And people would take the knockoff as real ones and envy you.

583
00:52:54,020 --> 00:52:55,590
Isn't it a lot of fun?

584
00:52:57,540 --> 00:53:03,930
Mrs. Hong. Long time no see. You look younger than ever.

585
00:53:04,490 --> 00:53:06,680
Sandra Wang, it's been a long time.

586
00:53:06,680 --> 00:53:11,140
Right, I went to New York, San Francisco

587
00:53:11,140 --> 00:53:13,410
because of work.

588
00:53:13,410 --> 00:53:16,670
Guys, come and meet our Mrs Hong.

589
00:53:33,190 --> 00:53:34,860
You know me, right?

590
00:53:34,860 --> 00:53:36,210
Yes.

591
00:53:36,210 --> 00:53:38,580
This is unbelievable! How dare you come back here?

592
00:53:38,580 --> 00:53:40,750
What are you doing here?

593
00:53:40,750 --> 00:53:42,790
It's not what you think.

594
00:53:42,790 --> 00:53:44,900
You are so ridiculous.

595
00:53:44,900 --> 00:53:46,740
You sold my ring,

596
00:53:46,740 --> 00:53:49,170
and how dare you come back to my house?

597
00:53:49,170 --> 00:53:53,100
You're such a cunning girl with innocent appearance.

598
00:53:54,140 --> 00:53:57,770
Min Hyuk really does have weird tastes.

599
00:53:59,780 --> 00:54:02,000
What are you doing here?

600
00:54:04,660 --> 00:54:05,860
What are you doing?

601
00:54:05,860 --> 00:54:07,390
Min Hyuk,

602
00:54:07,730 --> 00:54:09,770
Do you hang out with girls all like this?

603
00:54:09,770 --> 00:54:12,860
No, we don't have the kind of relationship.

604
00:54:12,860 --> 00:54:14,620
What do you mean by girls like this?

605
00:54:14,620 --> 00:54:16,980
Do I even have to spell that out?

606
00:54:16,980 --> 00:54:20,970
Isn't it obvious? She wants your money!

607
00:54:23,120 --> 00:54:25,430
You can't meet Min Hyuk anymore.

608
00:54:25,430 --> 00:54:27,510
I am not a man with know manner.

609
00:54:27,510 --> 00:54:30,090
I don't know what I would do.

610
00:54:34,510 --> 00:54:36,330
What do you think you're doing?

611
00:54:38,570 --> 00:54:43,410
I know men want to play around before getting married.

612
00:54:43,720 --> 00:54:47,510
But Min Hyuk you can't date with anybody.

613
00:54:47,510 --> 00:54:50,400
You don't have the right to say that.

614
00:54:50,930 --> 00:54:52,720
You wanted my father's money,

615
00:54:52,720 --> 00:54:55,330
Woman comes here like she is waiting my mother to die

616
00:54:55,330 --> 00:54:57,370
doesn't have the right to say that.

617
00:55:02,030 --> 00:55:03,020
Let's go.

618
00:55:13,440 --> 00:55:16,630
Are you crazy? How dare you come here?

619
00:55:17,250 --> 00:55:19,360
I didn't know this is your house.

620
00:55:19,360 --> 00:55:22,300
Is this what you've been doing to pay my debt?

621
00:55:27,050 --> 00:55:28,850
See you again, my friend.

622
00:55:32,790 --> 00:55:34,480
Excuse me,

623
00:55:34,480 --> 00:55:37,240
we have something urgent to talk about.

624
00:55:41,960 --> 00:55:44,940
By the way, did you get the present

625
00:55:44,940 --> 00:55:46,330
I sent you?

626
00:55:47,120 --> 00:55:49,520
Hope you like it.

627
00:56:05,310 --> 00:56:06,550
Want a drink?

628
00:56:10,020 --> 00:56:12,590
Not in the mood, drinking in daytime.

629
00:56:13,430 --> 00:56:14,950
You know Prosecutor Ahn, don't you?

630
00:56:15,780 --> 00:56:19,000
Wait! He started working for our legal team

631
00:56:19,000 --> 00:56:21,890
after resigning as a prosecutor.

632
00:56:21,890 --> 00:56:23,950
He's Attorney An now.

633
00:56:25,090 --> 00:56:26,780
Didn't you know?

634
00:56:27,280 --> 00:56:28,930
Look at your face!

635
00:56:30,170 --> 00:56:32,670
Do yo have any affairs or what?

636
00:56:32,670 --> 00:56:34,310
No.

637
00:56:35,070 --> 00:56:37,050
He is my friend.

638
00:56:37,680 --> 00:56:42,380
Seems I got a good friend because of you.

639
00:56:42,380 --> 00:56:46,430
What? Is it strange to find we are friends?

640
00:56:48,630 --> 00:56:53,530
Attorney An looked surprised to find we are together.

641
00:57:02,480 --> 00:57:07,030
Yes? I'll be right there.

642
00:57:10,790 --> 00:57:13,890
I won't be here anymore.

643
00:57:22,760 --> 00:57:23,840
You need to have a philosophy

644
00:57:23,840 --> 00:57:25,880
and an eye for beauty to sell our products, don't you?

645
00:57:25,880 --> 00:57:28,480
Sis, don't forget. Seventy thirty, I got seventy.

646
00:57:28,480 --> 00:57:30,850
How about stewed intestines and spirits?

647
00:57:33,750 --> 00:57:34,750
Hey!

648
00:57:45,150 --> 00:57:49,300
Do you know what you are doing? Do you know who he is?

649
00:57:49,300 --> 00:57:50,220
Yes.

650
00:57:50,220 --> 00:57:52,980
And you are still doing this?

651
00:57:52,980 --> 00:57:54,930
What about you?

652
00:57:55,500 --> 00:57:58,090
You quitted

653
00:57:58,090 --> 00:58:01,240
and work for him. What does that mean?

654
00:58:01,640 --> 00:58:03,130
I heard you are friends.

655
00:58:03,130 --> 00:58:06,170
Friends? Yeah.

656
00:58:06,170 --> 00:58:10,250
A toy he could play with as his will could also be called a friend.

657
00:58:10,250 --> 00:58:14,570
Quitting and working for him is not my will only.

658
00:58:16,900 --> 00:58:20,620
I don't want to talk about that anymore. What's your plan?

659
00:58:23,740 --> 00:58:25,970
I got debt to pay.

660
00:58:25,970 --> 00:58:28,390
I heard that my debt was transferred to him.

661
00:58:28,390 --> 00:58:30,730
I don't know how it happened.

662
00:58:31,430 --> 00:58:34,830
Yoo Jung, pull yourself together.

663
00:58:34,830 --> 00:58:37,340
There are reasons for him not letting go of you.

664
00:58:37,340 --> 00:58:39,000
But I still have to pay the debt.

665
00:58:39,000 --> 00:58:42,560
Do you know what he's done?

666
00:58:47,740 --> 00:58:51,430
He must hate me. He must despise me.

667
00:58:51,430 --> 00:58:54,110
Don't be so stupid.

668
00:58:54,110 --> 00:58:55,930
We have already paid for what we did.

669
00:58:55,930 --> 00:58:59,140
Last 4 years has been so terribly sad.

670
00:58:59,140 --> 00:59:01,650
Listen to me.

671
00:59:04,640 --> 00:59:08,540
I'm worried about you. You leave him now.

672
00:59:08,540 --> 00:59:12,770
I'll find out about the debt, and I'll make you know.

673
00:59:30,270 --> 00:59:31,670
Lee Hye Jin!

674
00:59:38,270 --> 00:59:39,840
Lee Hye Jin!

675
00:59:59,230 --> 01:00:02,490
Shit. Stop it. I'm not running away.

676
01:00:02,490 --> 01:00:03,970
I won't run.

677
01:00:13,480 --> 01:00:15,210
Just give me a punch.

678
01:00:15,210 --> 01:00:17,970
Isn't that why you are after me?

679
01:00:18,390 --> 01:00:23,510
Shit. I can't believe we meet like this.

680
01:00:24,790 --> 01:00:31,680
Punch you? Could that bring San back to me?

681
01:00:34,460 --> 01:00:35,450
Ok, if that's what you want.

682
01:00:35,450 --> 01:00:37,590
You can have it no matter how much you want it.

683
01:00:37,590 --> 01:00:38,860
What are you talking about?

684
01:00:40,540 --> 01:00:41,480
You bitch.

685
01:00:41,480 --> 01:00:42,530
What the fuck.

686
01:00:44,060 --> 01:00:45,020
Why?

687
01:00:45,020 --> 01:00:46,690
The hell you.

688
01:00:46,690 --> 01:00:50,690
What is it? What happened to San?

689
01:00:51,570 --> 01:00:53,350
What do you mean?

690
01:00:59,170 --> 01:01:00,570
San…

691
01:01:04,560 --> 01:01:06,890
is dead.

692
01:01:11,010 --> 01:01:22,470
That was the last time I held him in my arms.

693
01:01:25,730 --> 01:01:28,970
At first I was thinking what do I do if I meet you again.

694
01:01:28,970 --> 01:01:32,740
Every night, I tried to find what to do to feel better.

695
01:01:32,740 --> 01:01:36,100
Time just passed by.

696
01:01:37,800 --> 01:01:44,780
Why... in the end, I just wanna know why...

697
01:01:44,780 --> 01:01:51,010
Why did you do that to me and San.

698
01:01:52,000 --> 01:01:56,330
Why…

699
01:01:56,330 --> 01:02:03,160
I don't know. Not as much as you did, but I loved San.

700
01:02:03,160 --> 01:02:06,720
I mean it. They said San would be okay.

701
01:02:06,720 --> 01:02:13,180
They wanted me to stop you from getting your parole.

702
01:02:17,280 --> 01:02:18,450
My parole？

703
01:02:18,450 --> 01:02:21,840
I was manipulated.

704
01:02:23,130 --> 01:02:29,930
Yoo Jung, did you make someone really angry?

705
01:02:31,060 --> 01:02:33,610
Do you know what Min Hyuk did?

706
01:02:33,610 --> 01:02:35,550
Enjoy your time in jail.

707
01:02:35,550 --> 01:02:39,430
You are gonna be so miserable after you get out.

708
01:02:42,150 --> 01:02:45,260
You should suffer what I suffered.

709
01:02:45,260 --> 01:02:49,430
Lose you loved ones and there's nothing you can do.

710
01:04:11,170 --> 01:04:16,760
Next on Secret Love

711
01:04:17,160 --> 01:04:18,410
Look at this.

712
01:04:18,410 --> 01:04:19,820
What?

713
01:04:20,030 --> 01:04:22,190
What's the matter?

714
01:04:22,190 --> 01:04:25,610
You said you saw someone fall down there and just leave him there alone, right?

715
01:04:25,610 --> 01:04:27,370
Are these really a woman's footprint?

716
01:04:27,370 --> 01:04:30,490
It was the day the accident happened to Xu.

717
01:04:30,490 --> 01:04:33,380
If Attorney An knows how much I know about Attorney An…

718
01:04:33,380 --> 01:04:35,180
that might be a big shock.

719
01:04:35,180 --> 01:04:38,650
Is there a copy of the file in the black box of accident car.

720
01:04:38,650 --> 01:04:41,990
Could you please do me a favor?

721
01:04:41,990 --> 01:04:44,570
Did you really just left after you saw the accident

722
01:04:44,570 --> 01:04:46,820
without doing anything.
